\ Calling a declared-effect quotation whose body's actual delta contradicts the declaration must
\ raise stack-effect-mismatch. The declaration travels attached to the literal, so a compiled
\ body must materialize the value with the effect intact for the call-delta validation to fire.
\ This file runs under both the interpreter and eager suites against the same goldens.

use "testing" ;

"call-delta validation on a materialized literal" test-section

make-lying: ( -- q ) [ [ ( -- n ) 1 2 ] ] ;

[ make-lying call ] EStackEffectMismatch "declared one output but pushes two" assert-error-type
